{
  "id": "desktop",
  "version": "0.1.0",
  "kernelCompat": "^0.3.0",
  "description": "桌面交互（在用户屏幕上，用户能看见）：弹系统通知（长任务跑完提醒）、用系统默认程序打开工作区内文件或 http(s) 网址（用户说\"打开给我看\"就用它，不是无头的 browser.open）、读/写系统剪贴板。macOS / Linux / Windows 都走系统自带命令，零依赖、无需配置。",
  "license": "Apache-2.0",
  "install": {
    "type": "git",
    "url": "https://github.com/theyuyan/cak-plugins.git",
    "ref": "main",
    "subdir": "plugins/desktop"
  },
  "entrypoint": {
    "type": "subprocess",
    "command": "node",
    "args": [
      "dist/main.js"
    ]
  },
  "contracts": [
    {
      "name": "desktop.notify",
      "version": "1.0.0",
      "sampleArgs": {
        "title": "cak",
        "message": "conformance"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "desktop.open",
      "version": "1.0.0",
      "sampleArgs": {
        "target": "ftp://example.com/not-allowed"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "desktop.clipboard.read",
      "version": "1.0.0",
      "sampleArgs": {
        "maxChars": 100
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "desktop.clipboard.write",
      "version": "1.0.0",
      "sampleArgs": {
        "text": "cak conformance"
      }
    }
  ],
  "keywords": [
    "桌面",
    "通知",
    "系统通知",
    "弹通知",
    "提醒我",
    "打开文件",
    "打开网址",
    "默认程序打开",
    "剪贴板",
    "复制到剪贴板",
    "读剪贴板",
    "desktop",
    "notification",
    "notify",
    "toast",
    "open file",
    "open url",
    "clipboard",
    "copy",
    "paste",
    "pbcopy",
    "xdg-open"
  ],
  "setup": "无需配置。Linux 需要 libnotify-bin（notify-send）、xdg-utils、xclip 或 wl-clipboard；macOS / Windows 自带。安装时的一致性测试对 desktop.open 用一个会被拒绝的 ftp:// 目标（不会真开浏览器）；desktop.clipboard.write 的样例会覆盖剪贴板一次。",
  "source": "https://github.com/theyuyan/cak-plugins/tree/main/plugins/desktop",
  "tier": "T1"
}
